{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"设计系统运维","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/design-systems/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-release","title":"版本策略与发布流程","url":"/h/frontend/design-systems/operations/versioning-release","wordCount":804,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"contribution-governance","title":"多团队贡献治理","url":"/h/frontend/design-systems/operations/contribution-governance","wordCount":940,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"adoption-metrics","title":"采纳度量与系统健康","url":"/h/frontend/design-systems/operations/adoption-metrics","wordCount":1108,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 设计系统运维\n\n本章关注设计系统上线后的长期健康——版本策略与发布流程、多团队贡献治理模型、以及如何度量系统的采纳率与覆盖率。设计系统的价值不在发布日，而在持续演进的每一天。\n\n学完本章后，你将掌握语义化版本与 breaking change 管理策略、contribution model 的设计（inner source vs centralized），以及用数据驱动的指标体系持续证明设计系统的投资回报。\n"}